    "description": "<p><strong>COLD DRAGON</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Size</strong> Small</p>\n<p><strong>Level</strong> 4 (<strong>EL</strong> 4); <strong>DC</strong> 18</p>\n<p><strong>Initiative</strong> +30</p>\n<p><strong>Speed</strong> 30 feet; Fly 50; Swim 40</p>\n<p><strong>Senses</strong> Darkvision 65’, Nightvision 130’, Scent 40’</p>\n<p><strong>Languages</strong> Gantish, Low Tongue, Wyrmish</p>\n<p><strong>ABILITY SCORES</strong> <strong>STR</strong> +2, <strong>CON</strong> +2, <strong>DEX</strong> +3, <strong>INT</strong> +1, <strong>WIS</strong> +3, <strong>CHA</strong> +2</p>\n<p><strong>SKILLS</strong> Acrobatics +8(3), Arcana +6(3), Athletics +7(3), Climbing +8(3) Culture +6(3), Deception +7(3), Diplomacy +6(2), Intimidate +6(2), Meditation +7(2), Mental Focus +7(2), Nature +7(2), Perception +7(2), Power Manipulation +5(2), Sense Motive +7(2), Survival +7(2)</p>\n<p><strong>DEFENCE</strong><br>DB +19 (Base +14; Other +2 Stat +3); DR 4<br>Fort +11, Ref +12, Will +14<br>HP 76; Immunity cold, paralysis, sleep; Weakness fire</p>\n<p><strong>FEATS/SPECIAL</strong> Alertness, Ice Climb, Iron Will</p>\n<p><strong>Cold Dragon Breath</strong> 2 AP (arcane, cold, focus, invocation, save)<br>The dragon breathes a 15-foot cone that inflicts 4d8 cold damage. The breath weapon has the focus trait, and any targets may make a basic Reflex save to avoid damage.</p>\n<p><strong>ATTACKS</strong><br>Bite +9 (finesse) 1d6+2 piercing plus 1d6 cold<br>Claw +9 (agile, finesse, versatile - p) 1d5+2 slashing</p>\n<p><strong>MAGIC</strong><br>A cold dragon is a High Magic caster.<br>CL 1; Spellcraft +6; PP 18<br>Spells 4 x Cantrip, 2 additional spell (max PP 2).</p>\n<p><strong>SPECIAL ABILITIES BY LEVEL</strong> 6: Snowvision; 8: Draconic Assault; 10: Wing Buffet; 12: Frightful Aura; 14: Freezing Aura; 16: Draconic Shifting; 18: Freezing Blood; 20: Reflective Scales</p>\n<p><em>A cold dragon is a formidable, ice-breathing creature known for its chilling presence and mastery over frigid elements.</em></p>\n<p><em>Automated:</em> hatched by Dragon Tamer at level 4, with the skill ranks printed (B10-7), the feats printed (each counting as a pick made), its languages, immunities and weakness. The breath is 4d8 at 4 and a die a level after (C5), a Focus ability with a basic Reflex save at the creature DC; it grows as a cone with the table. Its specials arrive by its own level from the system's Creature Codex. Its DB is the printed block's (Graham, 28 October 2026): the system's creature rule, half its level as an other bonus and its class bonus − 2 as a status bonus. Its natural attacks follow the system's one size ladder (B10-10).</p>",
